+# WO-RUST-APPLE-PRESENTATION-01
+
+Implemented the safe `RgbaFrame` constructor and `Window::present_rgba` seam
+inside `vexel-platform-apple`. Frames are top-left, packed RGBA8 in sRGB with
+premultiplied alpha; axes are capped at 4096, storage at 64 MiB, and backing
+scale must be 1, 2, or 3.
