+Presentation copies bytes into `CFData`, builds a `CGImage` through a retained
+data provider, and publishes it on the view's `CALayer`. The layer owns the
+published image; the prior image and scale are held across replacement and
+restored if publication or invalidation raises. Pure validation tests cover
